---
name: appman-start
description: Start an appman-managed dev server. Prefer "appman up <profile>" when starting multiple apps with dependencies.
appman-version: {{appman_version}}
generated-at: {{generated_at}}
---

Run: `appman start $1`

Then block until healthy: `appman wait $1 --until healthy --timeout 60s`.

If `wait` exits with code 2 (timeout), run `appman errors $1 --structured` and `appman why $1` and report both.
